type: software

title: "Toy GPT: Context-2 Next-Token Model trained on Repository Tour Corpus"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-04-02"

authors:
  - family-names: Case
    given-names: Denise M.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6165-7389"
    affiliation: "Northwest Missouri State University, School of Computer Science and Information Systems, Maryville, MO, USA"

repository-code: "https://github.com/toy-gpt/train-302-context-2-repo-tour"
url: "https://toy-gpt.github.io/train-302-context-2-repo-tour/"
license: MIT

abstract: >
  A minimal, inspectable next-token prediction model trained on a repository
  tour corpus describing file and folder structures. Uses a context-2 window
  (two preceding tokens) to predict the next token via softmax regression.
  Part of the Toy GPT educational series illustrating how language model
  architecture and training data interact.

